     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Verb government and governed cases",
     "texto": [
      "The case depends on the verb and the construction. Learn each verb with its complement: **interesować się czymś** takes the instrumental; **potrzebować czegoś** takes the genitive; **czekać na kogoś/coś** takes the accusative.",
      "Do not generalise an ending across all verbs. Keep the preposition when it forms part of the construction, and check the number and gender changes in the examples."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
